    <string name="whatsnew_title">Parakeet 4.0</string>
    <string name="whatsnew_body">Brand new look and a simpler flow:\n• See at a glance when to wake up and how long you need\n• Tap an activity to include it, swipe to remove it\n• The alarm is created quietly in your Clock app, without duplicates\n• Your activities and exit time were kept\n\nThank you for using Parakeet!</string>

